      <p class="text-sm text-brand-500 font-medium mb-2">{cat}</p>
      <h1 class="font-heading text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-3">How to Stake Solana: Complete Beginner's Guide to Earning Passive Income 2026 | DogeKing</h1>
      <time class="text-sm text-gray-500">2026</time>
      
      <div class="mt-3 flex gap-2 flex-wrap">
        <span class="text-xs bg-gray-800 text-gray-300 px-2 py-1 rounded">defi</span>
      </div>
    </header>
    <div class="prose prose-invert prose-gray max-w-none">
      <p>Learn how to stake Solana (SOL) in 2026 with this beginner-friendly guide. Step-by-step staking instructions, validator selection, liquid staking o...</p>
    </div>
